    "summary": "Customer Leo Brandt (D202) requested a human specialist about order Q-7201 (Burger Barn, 2 classic burgers, fries, $36.59 charged). Promised 7:00 PM, picked up 6:40 PM. App/courier marked delivered at 6:58 PM 2.1 miles from address, but the real in-person handoff was at 7:47 PM (47 min late). Customer says he was home from 7:00 and nobody arrived until about 7:45, and disputes that the order was on time. Agent already issued a $5.60 late-delivery account credit (20% of $28 subtotal). Customer wants more review of the case. No refund issued."
   },
