   "text": "I've passed your case to a human specialist, reference ESC-700. They'll follow up within 24 hours. I can't promise what they'll decide.\n\nI've noted that you were home from 7:00 and that nothing arrived until about 7:45. The specialist will have the courier's record, the 6:58 PM \"delivered\" marker that was 2.1 miles away, and the $5.60 credit already on your account.\n\nIs there anything else I can help you with today?"
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "No, that's it for me. I'd like the specialist to actually look at the 6:58 \"delivered\" thing, because the app told me it was delivered and nothing was here. Thanks for the reference number, ESC-700."
